  "description": "500W Electric Tandem Ebike with Shimano 7-Speed and LED Headlights\nThe Micargi Aloha is a 500W electric tandem ebike enough power to help two riders get to where they need to go. Equipped with a 48V Samsung lithium ion battery, riders will get about 35 miles on a full charge depending on what mode is being utilized. With the speed sensor, riders will be able to utilize pedal assist and throttle when they need a little push. The Shimano Tourney 7 speed with an added 500W motor will really allow the riders to ride on any type of terrain. Though it is not recommended to ride anywhere with a steep uphill, a slight uphill is perfectly fine. The Micargi Aloha is with LED headlights that will provide light when riding in the dark and front and rear disc brakes for maximum braking power.\nSpecification:\nWhat’s Included:\nBattery & charger\n⚠️ Assembly Required: Partial assembly needed upon delivery.\n⚠️ Adult Riders Only",
